[{"title":"奉皇姊大长公主命题周曾秋塘图","author":"冯子振","text":"芙蓉满意陂湖秋，枯荷折苇林塘幽。\n沙凫野鸭浮清流，霜中鸣雁寒汀洲。\n黄芦红蓼叶尚抽，水石懒倦不自由。\n大年小景方绸缪，能事更费千金收。\n潇湘之南买一丘，并与梦泽长唱酬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29756,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵承旨白鼻騧图","author":"冯子振","text":"曲江洗刷墨满身，雄恣逸态何超群。\n眼中但觉肉胜骨，干也合让曹将军。\n嗟哉今人画唐马，艺精亦出曹韩下。\n玉堂学士重名誉，一纸千金不当价。\n山窗拥雪观画图，据鞍便欲擒于菟。\n天厩真龙有时有，杜老歌行绝代无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29757,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵鸥波高士图","author":"冯子振","text":"洛阳雪深冻阑干，高士僵卧饥袁安。\n忍贫束腹一榻寒，不忍持钵邻里干。\n令君晓鞭望门看，贤哉此公此操难。\n谁能为口须片肝，五公四世清节完。\n吴兴松雪峻笔端，□缣粉白□漫漫。\n俨若古意幅面摊，好事把玩应长叹！\n人间饱饭烦邯郸，功名回首□霏残。\n何如小忍聊盘桓，门前嵩少青巑岏。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29758,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵仲穆临李伯时凤头骢图","author":"冯子振","text":"洪崖先生住西山，移宅深密逃人寰。\n幅巾乌靴腰角带，阔袖袍色浓岚斑。\n一筇九节相携惯，矮干家僮蕉扇攀。\n崎岖步武转蹒跚，皂服轻袪行计办。\n一僮肩裸鞚白骡，俊驶难驭驰坡陀。\n后鞦侧畔跷足势，奈尔决骤奔倾何。\n蓝衫只手操鞭逐，席帽背擎无世俗。\n一僮未了一僮催，高束文书赤双足。\n一僮绿袂麻屦觕，臂挑庄叟大瓠壶。\n先生家具即此是，焉用检校随身符。\n豫章穹岩钥幽谷，雨捲云飞雾如沐。\n神仙狡狯踪迹奇，写到吴兴赵氏屋。\n谁传画卷秦淮边，妙意拾得希徵怜。\n海翁一见心缱绻，赠以菊径归田篇。\n玉禾自熟犁锄废，黄犊乌犍有馀地。\n雪骡水草久驯良，却后千年丹发匮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29759,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠弹琴刘世贤","author":"冯子振","text":"朔斋之孙元祐家，异世门阀凌秋霞。\n空山无人琴自语，历历往代虚豪华。\n清冰古雪松质峻，照眼何限桃李葩。\n坚持静操欲矫俗，淡泊安得退淫哇。\n朱丝弦上三太息，此事宁久迷尘沙。\n诸君耳浊筝琵琶，月明庭户留栖鸦。\n《高山流水》试一听，昭代复见真伯牙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29760,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"塔灯","author":"冯子振","text":"擎天一柱碍云低，破暗功同日月齐。\n半夜火龙蟠地轴，八方星象下天梯。\n光摇滟滪沿珠蚌，影落沧溟照水犀。\n文焰逼人高万丈，倒提铁笔向空题。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29761,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鹤骨笛","author":"冯子振","text":"胎仙脱胫寄飞琼，换羽移宫学凤鸣。\n喷月未醒千载梦，彻云犹带九皋声。\n管含芝露吹香远，调引松风入髓清。\n莫向山头吹暮雪，笼中媒老正关情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29762,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杨花二首 其一","author":"冯子振","text":"曾与行人惜翠条，而今飞絮满河桥。\n一分流水萍初碎，百尺春风雪未消。\n微扑妆楼啼半面，乍黏舞席折纤腰。\n沾泥更傍谁家砌，帘户新声紫燕娇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29763,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杨花二首 其二","author":"冯子振","text":"婉娩春风与愿违，悠扬风日暂无辉。\n不随芳树千林歇，还称游丝百尺飞。\n梦落吴蚕欺白茧，心随代马恋征衣。\n凤池踪迹逡巡到，未忍飘零拂钓矶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29764,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"旌表申孝子门","author":"冯子振","text":"竹熨轻舆到处安，水温半菽尽情欢。\n寸心不暂三晖置，万顷何如一亩宽。\n高盖门闾华黼黻，斑衣岁月老巾冠。\n遥怜续汉书申孝，千古申屠又有蟠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29765,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云林清远四时词四首 其一","author":"冯子振","text":"花分石径蝶衣裳，蜂恼晴檐燕雨香。\n解事野桃吹绮片，谁教赚到鹄仙乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29766,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云林清远四时词四首 其二","author":"冯子振","text":"脱箨斑筠绿节明，霖收梅子麦寒轻。\n诸峰隔截高低树，忽听初蝉第二声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29767,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云林清远四时词四首 其三","author":"冯子振","text":"月湿流萤歇懒烟，西南峰缺露原田。\n冰帘不倩匡山瀑，万丈银潢泻玉天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29768,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"云林清远四时词四首 其四","author":"冯子振","text":"嘉平腊酿渴茶铛，直待龙沙雪水烹。\n舞彻瑶台千岁翮，鹤丹回施范长生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29769,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题黄鹤楼","author":"冯子振","text":"鹤楼千尺倚晴阑，大别山前舞峻鸾。\n昨日英雄无问处，依然江汉涌波澜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29770,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题扬州琼花","author":"冯子振","text":"锦帆隐隐到天涯，古道残阳泣暮鸦。\n莫为龙舟更惆怅，庆陵依旧看琼花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29771,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题墨肘鱼","author":"冯子振","text":"平生骨气占南风，玉色鬐鳞海汐通。\n莫与粉红参石首，天机衮衮水流东。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29772,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉皇姊大长公主命题宋道君鸂鶒图卷","author":"冯子振","text":"鸂鶒滩头狎浪随，君王缣墨惯娱嬉。\n凄凉晚岁鸳鸯泺，漠雁沙鸿未必知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29773,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉皇姊大长公主命题郭恕先升龙图卷二首 其一","author":"冯子振","text":"建武神仙事渺茫，西池王母惜刘郎。\n赤龙一去无消息，儿子东方御榻旁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29774,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉皇姊大长公主命题郭恕先升龙图卷二首 其二","author":"冯子振","text":"万户千门筑汉宫，巍峨井干与天通。\n青禽当日衔书降，从此瑶池碧树红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29775,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉皇姊大长公主命题钱舜举硕鼠图","author":"冯子振","text":"黠吻工馋恣陆梁，粟初黄候未登场。\n君恩一穗填渠腹，可信年年盗太仓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29776,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题赵魏国双马图","author":"冯子振","text":"一马形躯百法全，生时灵气取山川。\n英雄正用同生死，那忍无声立仗前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29777,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桑乾河","author":"冯子振","text":"几年朔客渡桑乾，野水潺潺滴沥寒。\n回首燕南烟雨外，西风沙雁报平安。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29778,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"缙山道中","author":"冯子振","text":"榆林东北缙山围，百嶂千峰画卷挥。\n鞍影摇摇人意懒，秋风及早送将归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29779,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金莲川","author":"冯子振","text":"金莲川上富秋光，的皪花枝不著房。\n只合潘妃微步□，凌波罗袜寄芬芳。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29780,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其一 庭梅","author":"冯子振","text":"阑干六曲护春风，白雪生香满院中。\n夜静月明幺凤下，半窗疏影隔帘笼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29781,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其二 江梅","author":"冯子振","text":"有客孤山吊鹤归，半肩行李插疏枝。\n街头儿女不解事，刚道卖花人未回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29782,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其三 杖头梅","author":"冯子振","text":"短筇挑酒过西湖，折得冰梢傍玉壶。\n日暮醉归山路险，风流直待倩人扶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29783,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其四 隔帘梅","author":"冯子振","text":"玉堂咫尺有神仙，翠箔笼春信不传。\n日暮相思云树杳，一泓秋水月娟娟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29784,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其五 照镜梅","author":"冯子振","text":"妆阁开奁对晓寒，菱菱影里雪团团。\n素鸾舞罢却飞去，留得芳容正面看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29785,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其六 未开梅","author":"冯子振","text":"重重椒萼护轻寒，不放春心一点閒。\n可是花房芳信晚，故应缄密待春还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29786,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其七 乍开梅","author":"冯子振","text":"土脉阳和气候新，花房微露一分春。\n想应未识东君面，犹自含羞效浅颦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29787,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其八 半开梅","author":"冯子振","text":"暖入南枝气未匀，笑含芳意待馀馨。\n相看绝似瑶台夜，斜掩重门认不真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29788,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其九 全开梅","author":"冯子振","text":"玉脸盈盈总是春，都将笑色媚东君。\n道人放鹤归来晚，月下看花似白云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29789,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十 山中梅","author":"冯子振","text":"岩谷深居养素真，岁寒松竹淡相邻。\n孤根历尽冰霜苦，不识人间别有春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29790,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十一 水月梅","author":"冯子振","text":"浮玉溪边夜未期，暗香疏影静相宜。\n一时意味无人识，只有咸平处士知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29791,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十二 粉梅","author":"冯子振","text":"玉妃平碾白朱砂，散作春风六出花。\n夜半月明霜露重，满襟清泪湿年华。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29792,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十三 黄梅","author":"冯子振","text":"青子初肥色半鲜，绿阴深处压枝悬。\n日长几阵廉纤雨，正是江南四月天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29793,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十四 鸳鸯梅","author":"冯子振","text":"并蒂连枝朵朵双，偏宜照影傍寒塘。\n只愁画角惊吹散，片影分飞最可伤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29794,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十五 绿萼梅","author":"冯子振","text":"蕊珠宫里小仙娃，暂别椒房抑翠华。\n底事尘缘犹未断，谪来人世作名花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29795,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅花百咏 其十六 西湖梅","author":"冯子振","text":"苏老堤边玉一林，六桥风月是知音。\n任他桃李争欢赏，不为繁华易素心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":29796,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a